OL,3,GNEWSADrivers wrongly fined for
OL,4,Acongestion charge breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FMultiple motorists have reported being
OL,7,Fincorrectly fined for breaching a
OL,8,Fcity's temporary congestion charge, the
OL,9,Fday before it was replaced.
OL,11,FOn 28 September, the #5 daily
OL,12,Fcongestion fee to drive past six points
OL,13,Faround Oxford was replaced with a new
OL,14,F#70 fine as part of the Oxfordshire
OL,15,FCounty Council traffic filters trial.
OL,17,FBut drivers, including Rachel Griffin
OL,18,Ffrom Oxford, have said they have since
OL,19,Freceived congestion charge fines for
OL,20,Falleged breaches the day before it
OL,21,Fended.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
