OL,3,GNEWSADrivers wrongly fined for
OL,4,Acongestion charge breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe county council, which managed both
OL,7,Fthe old congestion charge and the new
OL,8,Ftraffic filters, said it was
OL,9,F"investigating" the issue - which it
OL,10,Fattributed to technical problems
OL,11,Fregarding permits.
